[
  {
    "id": "chengde-overview",
    "scenicId": "cn-hebei-chengde-bishushanzhuang",
    "topic": "overview",
    "title": "山庄的历史与遗产范围",
    "kind": "fact",
    "status": "curated",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-10",
    "sourceIds": ["official-overview", "unesco-703"],
    "profileFields": ["overview"],
    "content": "承德避暑山庄位于河北省承德市，是清代皇帝避暑和处理政务的离宫，1703年始建，1792年建成。避暑山庄及周围寺庙于1994年列入世界遗产名录。周围寺庙位于园外，不能当作园内景点。"
  },
  {
    "id": "chengde-landscape",
    "scenicId": "cn-hebei-chengde-bishushanzhuang",
    "topic": "landscape",
    "title": "山水与园林布局",
    "kind": "fact",
    "status": "curated",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-10",
    "sourceIds": ["official-overview"],
    "profileFields": ["highlights"],
    "content": "山庄西北为山区、东南为湖区、北部为平原区。宫殿和园林建筑与自然山水相结合，是理解皇家园林布局的线索。"
  },
  {
    "id": "chengde-danbo",
    "scenicId": "cn-hebei-chengde-bishushanzhuang",
    "topic": "spot",
    "title": "澹泊敬诚",
    "kind": "fact",
    "status": "curated",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-10",
    "sourceIds": ["official-danbo"],
    "profileFields": ["highlights"],
    "content": "澹泊敬诚建于1711年，1754年用楠木改建。这座殿堂曾用于重大庆典、朝觐和接见，体现山庄作为清代离宫的政务功能。"
  },
  {
    "id": "chengde-yanyulou",
    "scenicId": "cn-hebei-chengde-bishushanzhuang",
    "topic": "spot",
    "title": "烟雨楼",
    "kind": "fact",
    "status": "curated",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-10",
    "sourceIds": ["official-yanyulou"],
    "profileFields": ["highlights"],
    "content": "山庄烟雨楼建于1780年，位于青莲岛，借鉴浙江嘉兴南湖烟雨楼。它是山庄吸收江南园林意境的例子，不能把嘉兴的原址误说成承德园内位置。"
  },
  {
    "id": "chengde-jinshan",
    "scenicId": "cn-hebei-chengde-bishushanzhuang",
    "topic": "spot",
    "title": "金山岛",
    "kind": "fact",
    "status": "curated",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-10",
    "sourceIds": ["official-jinshan"],
    "profileFields": ["highlights"],
    "content": "山庄金山岛建于1703年，借鉴镇江金山寺，结合人工堆山和岛上建筑营造景观。讲解要区分山庄金山岛与镇江金山寺。"
  },
  {
